  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why This Happens",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Upper belly pain that spreads",
        "to your back, worse after eating,",
        "plus greasy stools",
        "",
        "The pancreas makes the enzymes",
        "that digest fat — scarring means",
        "fat leaves undigested"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sugary Drinks",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "One can is about 150 calories,",
        "almost all added sugar",
        "",
        "Calories the body doesn't need",
        "become triglycerides — and above",
        "500 mg/dL those raise pancreatitis risk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swap the Drink",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Water or unsweetened",
        "sparkling water instead",
        "",
        "Sweet taste keeps the craving",
        "going even with no calories —",
        "plain beats diet here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refined Starch",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "White bread sits in the high",
        "glycemic band, 70 to 100",
        "",
        "Fast digestion means a sharp",
        "blood sugar swing, and the excess",
        "gets stored as triglycerides"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swap the Bread",
      "char_file": "흰빵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Whole grain bread, oats,",
        "brown rice instead",
        "",
        "Fiber and intact starch slow",
        "digestion — same carbs,",
        "gentler arrival"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Big Fatty Meals",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Large, fatty meals ask the",
        "pancreas for a surge of enzyme",
        "",
        "Repeated often, that demand",
        "keeps the gland working",
        "harder than it should"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swap the Portions",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Small, frequent, lower-fat",
        "meals and plenty of fluids",
        "",
        "No alcohol at all if pancreatitis",
        "is in the picture — even a mild case"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Scarring in the pancreas",
        "does not reverse itself"
